      "id": "s002",
      "title": "Passage 2",
      "text": "I\u2019m Ren. And today we\u2019re asking a question that responsible savers don\u2019t always feel allowed to ask: When can you ease off saving for retirement? Because \u201csave more\u201d is useful advice when you\u2019re getting started. But if there\u2019s never a point where you can ease up, what exactly are you working toward? The answer needs more than reassurance. It needs a plan that can survive a little disappointment. Let\u2019s build one. First, there are three very different things people mean by easing off.",
