      "status": "pending",
      "attempts": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s013",
      "title": "Passage 13",
      "text": "But every purchase can be compared with decades of hypothetical investment growth. Follow that thought far enough, and you can talk yourself out of almost anything. Future you deserves security. Present you deserves a place in the budget too. So when can you ease off? When a realistic plan shows that lower contributions can still support your retirement, with room for setbacks, and you understand what you\u2019re choosing in return. You don\u2019t have to stop saving to start enjoying what saving has made possible.",
